const COURSE_DATA10=[
{id:'mosfet-switching',title:['MOS开关从零开始：N/P沟道、VGS与高低边','MOS switches: N/P channels, VGS and high/low-side placement'],pre:['components','divider-foundation','power','inductor-foundation'],week:59,lab:'mosfet',
 goal:['分别说清G、D、S，按源极电位判断N/P沟道是否增强，并避免把阈值当成充分导通。','Identify G, D and S, evaluate N/P enhancement relative to the source and distinguish threshold from useful on-state performance.'],
 sections:[
 ['先找到三只脚，不从外壳猜顺序','Identify terminals before guessing from a package','MOSFET常见三端是栅极G、漏极D、源极S。栅极控制沟道，负载主电流主要经过D与S。实体封装的1、2、3脚顺序必须查准确型号和封装图；TO-220、SOT-23以及不同厂家的相似外壳都不能只凭外观互换。先在纸上把器件符号、引脚编号与实物方向对应，再去连板。','A common MOSFET has gate G, drain D and source S. The gate controls the channel; main load current flows through D and S. Match the exact part and package drawing to physical pin numbers. Similar TO-220 or SOT-23 outlines do not establish interchangeable pinouts. Draw the symbol, numbered pins and viewing direction before wiring.'],
 ['控制量是VG减VS','The control voltage is VG minus VS','VGS=VG−VS，其中VG与VS先相对同一个参考地测量。例如VG=3.3 V、VS=0 V，VGS=3.3 V；若源极上升到3 V而栅极仍3.3 V，VGS只剩0.3 V。操作台的参考电位变化用来观察这个差别：两个端点同时整体上移，而差值不变时，理想器件的增强条件不变。','VGS=VG−VS, with both terminal voltages measured against the same reference. A gate at 3.3 V and source at zero gives 3.3 V; if the source rises to 3 V while the gate stays at 3.3 V, only 0.3 V remains. Moving both terminals by the same offset preserves VGS and the ideal enhancement condition.'],
 ['N沟道低边：开关放在负载下面','N-channel low-side: switch below the load','低边连接按电流路径看：电源正端→负载→漏极D→源极S→GND。源极接近控制器的地，因此GPIO相对地的高电平通常也成为正VGS。关断时负载下端可能升到电源附近，不是始终0 V；这会影响与负载共用的信号参考。负载若是LED仍要串限流电阻，MOS本身不能替代限流设计。','A low-side path is supply positive → load → drain → source → GND. With the source near controller ground, a GPIO high usually creates positive VGS. When off, the lower load terminal may rise toward supply rather than staying at zero, affecting signal references. An LED still needs current limiting; the MOSFET does not replace its series resistor.'],
 ['P沟道高边：把栅极拉低才增强','P-channel high-side: pulling the gate down enhances it','高边开关放在电源正端与负载之间。P沟道源极接高电位，漏极接负载，栅极相对源极降低时VGS为负。源极5 V，栅极5 V时VGS=0，通常关断；栅极1.7 V时VGS=−3.3 V，增强。N/P不是“永远高电平/低电平”的口令，要先写出源极与栅极两个电位。','A high-side switch sits between supply positive and the load. A P-channel source is at the higher potential and its drain feeds the load. Lowering gate voltage relative to the source gives negative VGS. At source 5 V, gate 5 V gives zero and normally off; gate 1.7 V gives −3.3 V and enhancement. Always write both terminal voltages instead of memorizing a logic-high slogan.'],
 ['阈值不是推荐驱动电压','Threshold is not the recommended drive voltage','VGS(th)是在规定的小漏极电流等测试条件下测得的开始导通门槛，不保证此时可以低损耗带动负载。选3.3 V GPIO驱动的器件，要查RDS(on)是否在接近实际VGS的条件下有保证值，同时看温度、额定电流和安全工作区。操作台“逻辑型/标准型”是两组假想参数，不能把它们当某一真实型号的数据手册。','VGS(th) is measured at a specified small drain current and other test conditions. It does not guarantee low-loss load switching. For a 3.3 V GPIO, check whether RDS(on) is specified at a relevant gate drive, alongside temperature, current and safe operating area. The bench logic/standard choices are hypothetical parameter sets, not specifications for a real part.'],
 ['MOS的饱和区不等于开关完全导通','MOS saturation does not mean a fully on switch','本课简化模型分截止、线性/欧姆区和饱和区。MOS用于低损耗开关时，常希望VDS较小、进入近似电阻性的区域；“饱和”一词在MOS里描述另一种电流关系，不能照搬BJT的开关饱和概念。功耗先用P≈ID×VDS判断；已知适用条件下RDS(on)时，可估P≈I²RDS(on)。','This simplified model distinguishes cutoff, linear/ohmic and saturation regions. A low-loss MOS switch is generally operated with small VDS in a resistive region. MOS saturation describes a different current relation from BJT switch saturation. Estimate dissipation with ID×VDS, or I²RDS(on) when the resistance specification applies.'],
 ['为什么高边N沟道需要额外驱动','Why a high-side N-channel often needs extra drive','N沟道也能做高边，但当源极随负载升高时，栅极必须继续高于源极足够多。只把栅极接到与电源相同的电压，未必能让负载得到完整电源；可能成为源极跟随行为。实际高边驱动器可使用电荷泵或自举等结构，工作条件各有约束。本入门台只演示N低边/P高边，不模拟这些驱动电路。','N-channel devices can be high-side switches, but their gates must remain sufficiently above rising source voltage. Connecting the gate merely to the supply may create source-follower behavior instead of passing the full rail. Charge-pump or bootstrap drivers address this under their own constraints. This beginner bench models N low-side and P high-side only.'],
 ['栅极像电容，关断状态也要定义','The gate is capacitive and needs a defined off state','理想栅极稳态电流很小，不代表切换时不要电流；驱动器要充放栅电荷。串联栅电阻影响边沿与振铃，栅源下拉或上拉用于避免上电时浮空。N低边常把栅极拉向源极以默认关断，P高边则拉向高电位源极。电阻值应按驱动速度、漏电和功耗选择，不能把一个教学值当通用配方。','Small steady gate current does not eliminate switching current: the driver charges and discharges gate charge. A series gate resistor affects edges and ringing; a gate-to-source bias resistor defines the state during startup. Pull an N low-side gate toward its source to default off; pull a P high-side gate toward its high source. Choose values from the actual driver and circuit requirements.'],
 ['体二极管和感性负载不是同一件事','Body diode and inductive-load protection differ','常见分立MOS含体二极管，方向与D/S接法有关，因此“关断”不意味着两个方向都完全隔离。N低边带线圈时，关断会让线圈试图维持电流，通常需要按回路设计续流或钳位路径；不要假设MOS体二极管自然解决所有漏极过压。实物还需核对VDS、VGS绝对最大值与瞬态条件。','Common discrete MOSFETs contain a body diode, so off does not necessarily block both current directions. When a low-side MOS drives a coil, turnoff requires a designed freewheel or clamp path as current continues. The body diode is not a universal solution to drain overvoltage. Check VDS, VGS absolute limits and transient conditions for the real circuit.'],
 ['先测相对电压，再查为什么不亮','Diagnose relative voltage before replacing parts','在台面先选N低边，依次观察VG、VS、VGS、VDS和负载电流；再改P高边重复。若实物不亮，按供电/共地→脚序→VGS方向与幅值→LED方向/限流→负载电流排查。P高边源极5 V而GPIO最高3.3 V时，栅极可能无法回到源极而完全关断；应设计电平转换，不能让5 V通过上拉反灌不耐5 V的GPIO。','On the bench inspect VG, VS, VGS, VDS and current in N low-side mode, then repeat with P high-side. For hardware, check supply/common ground, pinout, VGS sign and magnitude, LED polarity/current limit and load current. A 3.3 V GPIO may not turn off a P-device whose source is 5 V. Use suitable level translation without pulling a non-tolerant GPIO up to 5 V.']
 ],example:['课堂N管假设Vth=1.5 V、K=0.04 A/V²，5 V电源、2 V LED、330 Ω电阻。VG=1.6 V且VS=0时，过驱动u=0.1 V，饱和区模型ID=K×u²/2=0.2 mA，VDS=5−2−0.0002×330=2.934 V。虽然已过阈值，LED电流远小于约9 mA的理想上限。再把VG=3.3 V，与负载方程联立得到VDS约0.125 V、ID约8.71 mA；这是该假想模型结果。','For the classroom N-device, Vth=1.5 V and K=0.04 A/V², with 5 V supply, 2 V LED and 330 Ω. VG=1.6 V and VS=0 gives overdrive u=0.1 V, so saturation-model ID=K×u²/2=0.2 mA and VDS=2.934 V. Crossing threshold still gives far less than the roughly 9 mA ideal-load limit. At VG=3.3 V, solving with the load gives about 0.125 V and 8.71 mA for this hypothetical device.'],
 error:['把VGS(th)当充分导通电压；只看VG对地；把P管高边直接当3.3V逻辑的反相开关；混淆MOS与BJT饱和。','Treating threshold as full enhancement; reading VG without VS; treating a 5 V P-channel high side as a direct 3.3 V logic inverter; confusing MOS and BJT saturation.'],
 task:[['比较同一LED负载上的N低边与P高边。','Compare N low-side and P high-side control of the same LED load.'],['源极5 V、栅极3.3 V时，P管VGS是多少，能否凭“高电平”断言关断？','For P-channel source 5 V and gate 3.3 V, what is VGS and can logic high alone prove it is off?'],['用MOS台逐次设低于阈值、刚过阈值和较强驱动，记录G/S对地电压、VGS、VDS与电流。','Set below-threshold, just-above-threshold and stronger drive in the MOS bench; record terminal voltages, VGS, VDS and current.'],['解释电流为何同时受器件与负载限制，并指出哪个读数变化证明源极参考的重要性。','Explain device and load limits and identify evidence that the source reference matters.'],['选一份真实器件资料，只做纸面选型：标出脚序、VGS(th)、RDS(on)测试VGS和绝对最大VGS。','Use a real datasheet for a paper-only selection: locate pinout, threshold, RDS(on) test VGS and absolute VGS limit.'],['保留N/P两组端电位表和一张标注过的选型记录。','Keep N/P terminal-voltage tables and an annotated selection record.'],['算对VGS符号，区分开始导通与低损耗，能解释3.3V控制5V高边的关断问题。','Calculate VGS sign, distinguish onset from low-loss conduction and explain the 3.3 V control/5 V high-side off-state problem.']],refs:['mos','mosdata']},
{id:'bjt-switching',title:['三极管从零开始：NPN/PNP、基极电阻与工作区','BJT switches: NPN/PNP, base resistance and operating regions'],pre:['components','power','divider-foundation'],week:61,lab:'bjt',
 goal:['算出基极电流，判断截止、放大或饱和，并分别画出NPN低边和PNP高边回路。','Calculate base current, distinguish cutoff/active/saturation and trace NPN low-side and PNP high-side paths.'],
 sections:[
 ['B、C、E不是MOS的三只脚','B, C and E are not MOS terminals','BJT的三个端子是基极B、集电极C、发射极E。外观看起来像小MOS的三脚元件，内部工作方式与引脚排列却可能完全不同。先查完整型号、封装、平面朝向与引脚编号；不能把NPN换成PNP而不改极性，也不能按“左中右”记住所有三极管。','A BJT has base B, collector C and emitter E. A three-lead package may resemble a MOSFET while using a different mechanism and pin order. Check the complete part, package and viewing direction. NPN and PNP are not interchangeable without changing polarity, and a left-middle-right rule does not fit every transistor.'],
 ['NPN低边的两条电流路径','Trace both paths in an NPN low-side switch','发射极接GND，集电极接负载下端。负载电流路径为电源→负载→C→E→GND；基极驱动路径为GPIO→基极电阻RB→B→E→GND。两条路径在发射极汇合，IE=IC+IB。GPIO并非直接提供全部负载电流，但它必须提供所需的基极电流，不能假定驱动完全不耗电流。','Connect emitter to GND and collector to the lower load terminal. Load current follows supply → load → C → E → ground. Base drive follows GPIO → RB → B → E → ground. They combine at the emitter: IE=IC+IB. The GPIO need not supply all load current, but it must supply the required base current.'],
 ['基极电阻为什么不能省','Why the base resistor is necessary','基极—发射极正向偏置时类似导通的结，电流对电压十分敏感。不能把一个低阻GPIO直接当成限流元件。课堂估算取VBE≈0.7 V，IB≈(Vdrive−VE−0.7)/RB，负值按截止处理。真实VBE随电流、温度和器件变化，0.7 V只是估算条件，不是任何状态都精确固定。','The forward-biased base-emitter junction has a steep current-voltage relation. A low-impedance GPIO is not a current limiter. A classroom estimate is IB≈(Vdrive−VE−0.7)/RB, clipped to cutoff when negative. Real VBE varies with current, temperature and part; 0.7 V is an assumption, not an exact universal constant.'],
 ['放大区：β不是永远不变','Forward-active operation and variable beta','在适用的放大区，常用IC≈βIB作初步估计。但β随器件个体、集电极电流、温度和VCE而变化，数据手册列的是指定条件。若你算得βIB已经超过负载能提供的电流，就不能继续套用线性放大公式；必须与电源、负载和管压降一起判断工作区。','In the forward-active region, IC≈βIB is a first estimate. Beta varies with part, collector current, temperature and VCE, and datasheet values apply under stated conditions. If βIB exceeds what the source and load can supply, the active-region formula cannot be continued blindly; solve with the load and transistor voltage.'],
 ['饱和区：电流由负载限制','Saturation: the load limits current','作为开关时常希望BJT进入饱和，使VCE较低。课堂取VCE(sat)=0.2 V，5 V、2 V LED和330 Ω负载允许IC≈(5−2−0.2)/330=8.485 mA。继续增加基极电流不会让这个电阻回路产生任意大的IC，但会增加驱动负担并可能影响关断时间。实际VCE(sat)要按指定IC和IB读手册。','A BJT switch is often driven into saturation for a small VCE. With the classroom VCE(sat)=0.2 V, a 5 V supply, 2 V LED and 330 Ω permit about 8.485 mA. More base current cannot force arbitrary current through this resistor load; it increases drive burden and may affect turnoff. Read real VCE(sat) at its specified IC and IB.'],
 ['如何用强迫β估算基极电阻','Estimate base drive with a forced beta','设计开关不能只拿一个典型β乐观计算。可按数据手册饱和测试条件选保守的IC/IB目标，再核对GPIO电流能力。例如目标IC约8.5 mA，若纸面选择强迫β=10，则IB约0.85 mA；3.3 V驱动、估VBE=0.7 V时RB≈(3.3−0.7)/0.00085≈3.06 kΩ。标准阻值、容差与实际VBE范围仍需复核。','Do not size switch drive from an optimistic typical beta alone. Choose an IC/IB target consistent with saturation test conditions, then check GPIO capability. For about 8.5 mA with a paper-design forced beta of 10, IB is about 0.85 mA. At 3.3 V and assumed VBE=0.7 V, RB≈3.06 kΩ. Check standard values, tolerance and the actual VBE range.'],
 ['PNP高边：参考发射极看极性','PNP high-side: reference the emitter','PNP发射极接高电位，集电极向下接负载，基极经电阻拉得比发射极低时导通。以VE=5 V为例，基极驱动端5 V可接近关断；驱动端1.7 V配10 kΩ，在0.7 V结压降假设下，基极电流幅值约260 µA。这里用的是驱动电阻外侧电位，不把它误当实际B脚电压。','A PNP emitter sits at the higher potential and its collector feeds the load. Pulling the base below the emitter through a resistor drives it on. With VE=5 V, a 5 V drive can approach off; a 1.7 V drive through 10 kΩ gives about 260 µA under the 0.7 V junction assumption. That is the resistor drive-side voltage, not the actual base-terminal voltage.'],
 ['为什么3.3V GPIO不能直接解决所有5V高边','Why a 3.3 V GPIO is not a universal 5 V high-side driver','PNP发射极5 V而GPIO高电平只有3.3 V时，基极仍可能被拉低而导通，且有电流进入GPIO保护结构的风险。实际常用额外级做电平转换，并使默认关断状态明确。不要靠把基极电阻无限增大来代替正确接口；那可能只是让负载半开、结果依赖漏电和温度。','For a 5 V PNP emitter, a 3.3 V GPIO high may still pull the base low enough to conduct and can inject current into GPIO protection structures. Use an appropriate translation stage and defined default-off bias. Increasing the base resistor indefinitely is not a substitute for a correct interface; it may leave a poorly controlled partial-on condition.'],
 ['功耗、续流与速度都要看','Check power, current decay and switching speed','BJT热耗散可先估PC≈VCE×IC，基极回路也有功耗。若处于放大区且VCE较大，即使电流不大也可能比饱和开关更热。驱动继电器或电机时要设计感性电流的续流/钳位路径；深饱和还可能带来储存时间。本台为静态分段模型，不计算温升、储存电荷、雪崩或真实器件寿命。','Estimate collector dissipation with VCE×IC; the base path also consumes power. A larger VCE in active operation can dissipate more than a saturated switch. Relays and motors need a suitable inductive decay/clamp path, and deep saturation can add storage time. This static piecewise bench omits temperature, stored charge, avalanche and lifetime.'],
 ['把“暗、亮、断”解释成工作点','Explain dim, bright and off as operating points','在台面用NPN驱动0.75 V，再升至3.3 V，观察IB、IC和VCE；再用PNP镜像电位比较。实际排查先核供电和脚序，再量RB两端压降估IB，然后量VCE判断工作区。若算出足够IB却没有负载电流，检查负载方向、断线与器件接反；不要只看LED亮度就宣布电路可靠。','Use 0.75 V then 3.3 V NPN drive and inspect IB, IC and VCE, then compare mirrored PNP voltages. On hardware verify supply and pinout, measure RB drop to estimate IB, then measure VCE. Adequate calculated base drive with no load current calls for checks of load polarity, open wiring and reversed terminals. Brightness alone is not a reliability test.']
 ],example:['课堂β=100、RB=10 kΩ、VBE=0.7 V。NPN发射极0 V，驱动0.75 V时IB=(0.75−0.7)/10000=5 µA，IC=0.5 mA，VCE=5−2−0.0005×330=2.835 V，属放大区。改3.3 V后IB=260 µA，βIB=26 mA超过负载允许值，所以取IC≈8.485 mA、VCE≈0.2 V进入饱和。PNP的VE=5 V，驱动4.25/1.7 V分别对应这两组电流幅值。','Assume beta 100, RB=10 kΩ and VBE=0.7 V. An NPN emitter at zero with 0.75 V drive gives IB=5 µA, IC=0.5 mA and VCE=2.835 V, an active operating point. At 3.3 V, IB=260 µA and βIB=26 mA exceeds the load capability, so IC≈8.485 mA and VCE≈0.2 V in saturation. A PNP emitter at 5 V with drive 4.25/1.7 V mirrors these current magnitudes.'],
 error:['把B极直接接GPIO而没有限流；以固定β保证所有负载；把驱动端电位当实际基极电位；将C与E随意调换。','Omitting base current limiting, assuming fixed beta guarantees every load, confusing drive-side and base-terminal voltage, or swapping C and E.'],
 task:[['为同一个LED负载比较BJT截止、放大与饱和。','Compare cutoff, active and saturated BJT operation with the same LED load.'],['驱动从0.75 V升到3.3 V时，电流会按βIB一直增至26 mA吗？','Does raising drive from 0.75 V to 3.3 V make collector current reach 26 mA indefinitely through βIB?'],['在BJT台按例题设NPN两组驱动，记录IB/IC/VCE；切PNP后把驱动电位相对发射极镜像。','Set both NPN examples, record IB/IC/VCE, then mirror drive relative to the emitter for PNP.'],['把基极计算和负载允许电流写成两个限制，说明最终由哪一个限制。','Write the base-drive and load-current limits separately and identify the active constraint.'],['纸面按强迫β=10重算一个基极电阻，再到真实手册核对其饱和条件和引脚。','Recalculate a base resistor on paper with forced beta 10, then verify real saturation conditions and pinout.'],['保存三种工作区读数与一份基极电阻计算。','Keep three operating-region readings and one base-resistor calculation.'],['两条电流路径和电阻作用解释正确；能区分模型β与数据手册条件。','Explain both current paths and the resistor correctly, distinguishing modeled beta from datasheet conditions.']],refs:['npn','pnp']},
{id:'vscode-first-build',title:['VS Code第一份C工程：文件、终端、编译与运行','Your first VS Code C project: files, terminal, build and run'],pre:['win-files','win-paths','win-cmd','c-build'],week:29,tool:'ide',
 goal:['从空文件夹建立能复现的小工程，分清编辑器、扩展、终端、编译器和可执行程序。','Build a reproducible project from an empty folder and distinguish editor, extension, terminal, compiler and executable.'],
 sections:[
 ['先分清五个角色','Separate five different tools','VS Code主要提供编辑与集成界面；C/C++扩展提供语言服务等能力；终端运行一个命令解释器；gcc或其他编译器把源文件变成目标程序；目标程序才执行你的C逻辑。安装扩展不等于安装编译器。网页中的IDE训练台只是这些步骤的教学状态机，不启动你电脑上的VS Code或真实gcc。','VS Code provides editing and integration. The C/C++ extension adds language services; a terminal hosts a command shell; gcc or another compiler produces a target program; that program executes your C logic. Installing an extension does not install a compiler. The web IDE trainer models this workflow without launching your real editor or gcc.'],
 ['从一个新文件夹开始','Begin with a new project folder','先在文件资源管理器建练习文件夹，例如Documents下的c-lab。打开VS Code，选择File→Open Folder（文件→打开文件夹），选这个文件夹并确认。左侧Explorer此时显示项目根。若只双击一个散落的.c文件，终端默认目录、相对路径和以后新增文件可能不在同一个工程里；先确认左侧根目录名称。','Create a practice folder such as c-lab under Documents. In VS Code choose File → Open Folder and select it. Explorer should show that folder as the project root. Opening an isolated .c file can leave terminal location and later files outside the intended project. Confirm the root name before writing code.'],
 ['新建main.c并真正保存','Create main.c and save the buffer','在左侧Explorer点New File，输入main.c。写入本课最小例子后按Ctrl+S；文件名末尾必须是.c，不是main.c.txt。标签上的未保存提示消失只说明编辑缓冲区已写入文件，不说明程序编译成功。用资源管理器核对文件存在，再回编辑器；不要把终端输出窗口当源码编辑区。','Use New File in Explorer and name it main.c. Enter the minimal example and press Ctrl+S. The extension must be .c, not main.c.txt. Removing the unsaved indicator means the buffer was written, not compiled. Check that the file exists in the folder, and keep source editing separate from the terminal output panel.'],
 ['打开终端，确认环境与当前位置','Open a terminal and identify environment and directory','选择Terminal→New Terminal。看提示符辨认PowerShell、CMD或Linux/WSL，再查询当前位置和文件：PowerShell可用Get-Location与Get-ChildItem，CMD用cd与dir，Linux用pwd与ls。此前若把gcc装在WSL，它不自动等于Windows终端也有gcc。选择同一套已配置环境，本课不通过修改陌生系统目录来“修复”找不到文件。','Choose Terminal → New Terminal. Identify PowerShell, CMD or Linux/WSL from the prompt and check location/files: Get-Location/Get-ChildItem, cd/dir, or pwd/ls respectively. A gcc installed in WSL is not automatically a Windows-terminal compiler. Use the environment you previously configured rather than changing unrelated system folders to hide path mistakes.'],
 ['先证明编译器可用，再编译源码','Prove the compiler is available before compiling','在所选终端输入gcc --version。若提示命令不存在，先修复该环境的安装或PATH，然后新开终端复查；这不是C语法错误，也不是USB板卡问题。若返回版本，记录它，并确认当前目录有main.c。网页训练中“缺编译器”是可选故障，修好后仍要保存源文件；两个问题不能用一次成功动画混在一起。','Run gcc --version in the selected terminal. A command-not-found result requires checking installation or PATH in that environment, then reopening the terminal; it is not a C syntax or USB-board error. If a version appears, record it and confirm main.c in the current directory. Compiler availability and saving the source are separate checks in the trainer.'],
 ['一条编译命令里每部分做什么','Read each part of a compile command','若已配置Windows版gcc，在含main.c的目录运行gcc -std=c17 -Wall -Wextra main.c -o hello.exe。gcc是工具，选项要求C17和常见警告，main.c是输入，-o后是输出名字。在Linux/WSL中可用-o hello并运行./hello。输出后缀.exe本身不决定程序适用于哪个系统，真正决定它的是编译器目标平台。','With a configured Windows gcc, run gcc -std=c17 -Wall -Wextra main.c -o hello.exe where main.c exists. The tool is gcc, options select C17 and warnings, main.c is input and -o names output. On Linux/WSL use -o hello and run ./hello. An .exe suffix alone does not define the target operating system; the compiler target does.'],
 ['从第一条错误开始读','Start with the first relevant diagnostic','如果终端给出main.c:行号:列号和expected之类提示，先跳到那个位置，检查前一行是否缺分号、括号或引号。一次修一个根因，再保存与重新编译。后面的多条错误可能是前面一个错误引发的连锁反应；只看到最后一句编译失败不足以定位原因。警告也应读，但警告不必然等于编译已失败。','When a diagnostic gives main.c:line:column, inspect that location and the previous line for missing punctuation or delimiters. Fix one root cause, save and rebuild. Later errors may cascade from the first one; the final failure summary is not the diagnosis. Read warnings too, while distinguishing them from a failed compilation.'],
 ['运行生成物，不是运行源码文件名','Run the output, not the source filename','Windows PowerShell通常用.\hello.exe运行当前目录的程序；CMD可用hello.exe；Linux/WSL通常用./hello。终端应出现例子的输出。双击.exe可能窗口一闪而过，所以初学阶段从已有终端运行更易看到结果。编译失败后旧hello.exe可能仍在，若误运行旧文件，会误以为新代码生效；确认本次构建成功再运行。','In PowerShell use .\hello.exe, in CMD hello.exe, or in Linux/WSL ./hello. Read the output in that terminal. Double-clicking a console executable may close its window immediately. A failed build can leave an older executable in place, so running it does not prove the edited code worked. Confirm a successful current build first.'],
 ['红色波浪线与真实编译是不同证据','Editor diagnostics and actual build output differ','IntelliSense的配置、include路径或编译器选择可能与实际构建不一致。编辑区红线帮助定位，但最终要看自己运行的编译命令与输出。Run按钮、tasks.json和launch.json只是封装构建/运行/调试步骤；初学时先掌握手动流程，再理解它们引用哪个文件和工具。不要为了消除红线删除正确代码或随意关闭所有检查。','IntelliSense include paths or compiler settings can differ from the actual build. Red underlines are useful hints; the executed compiler command is separate evidence. Run buttons, tasks.json and launch.json wrap build/run/debug steps. Learn the manual sequence first and inspect which files and tools those settings invoke instead of deleting correct code or disabling all checks.'],
 ['把工程交给另一台电脑复现','Make the project reproducible elsewhere','保留main.c与简短README，写明操作系统/终端、编译器版本、编译命令和预期输出。新建一个练习副本，只从这些文件重建，不依赖你旧目录里的.exe。不要把个人绝对路径、账户凭据、整个用户缓存放进工程。训练台完成只证明理解教学流程；真实环境必须用真实编译输出与运行结果另行验收。','Keep main.c and a short README specifying OS/shell, compiler version, build command and expected output. Rebuild from a fresh copy without relying on an old executable. Exclude personal absolute paths, credentials and user caches. Completing the trainer proves a workflow exercise; validate a real setup with actual compiler output and execution separately.']
 ],example:['源码的main函数声明int a=2、b=3，再用printf("sum=%d\\n", a+b)输出结果并return 0。保存后编译应产生新的可执行文件，运行输出sum=5。把b改成4却不保存，重新编译仍读取磁盘旧值；保存再编译才输出sum=6。此实验用来分辨编辑缓冲、磁盘源码与可执行文件三个版本。','A main function declares int a=2, b=3, prints with printf("sum=%d\\n", a+b) and returns zero. Save, build and run to get sum=5. Change b to 4 without saving: a rebuild still reads the old disk version. Save and rebuild to obtain sum=6. This distinguishes the editor buffer, disk source and executable.'],
 error:['扩展已安装就认为有编译器；终端不在项目目录；修改未保存；构建失败却运行旧.exe；把WSL与Windows环境混用。','Assuming an extension supplies a compiler; wrong terminal directory; unsaved changes; running a stale executable after failure; mixing WSL and Windows environments.'],
 task:[['建立一份别人能从源码重建的两数相加工程。','Create a two-number addition project another learner can rebuild.'],['修改代码但不保存，编译读取哪一份内容？编译失败后旧程序还在吗？','Which content does compilation read after an unsaved edit, and can an old executable remain after failure?'],['在IDE训练区选择VS Code模式，完成建文件、保存、确认目录与编译器、编译、运行，再各触发一次未保存与语法错误。','In the VS Code training mode create/save a file, confirm directory/compiler, build and run; then trigger an unsaved-edit case and a syntax error.'],['用三栏表记录编辑内容、磁盘文件和运行输出，定位每次失败发生在哪一层。','Track editor content, disk source and output in three columns and identify the failed layer each time.'],['在自己已配置的真实C环境重建一个只改输出文字的副本；把真实结果与教学结果分别标注。','Rebuild a copy with different output text in your configured real C environment, labeling real and simulated evidence separately.'],['保留main.c、README、编译器版本与成功/失败日志摘要。','Keep main.c, README, compiler version and concise success/failure evidence.'],['能解释并复现保存→构建→运行，不把命令不存在、语法错与旧程序输出混为一谈。','Reproduce save→build→run and distinguish missing tools, syntax errors and stale output.']],refs:['vscode','terminal']},
{id:'arduino-ide-workflow',title:['Arduino IDE从零开始：板卡、端口、库与上传','Arduino IDE: boards, ports, libraries and uploading'],pre:['win-tools','win-files','c-functions','arduino'],week:49,tool:'ide',
 goal:['把草图、板卡核心、具体板型、USB端口和库分清，并完成编译/上传/串口三步验收。','Distinguish sketch, board core, board model, USB port and libraries, then verify compilation, upload and serial output separately.'],
 sections:[
 ['草图、核心和库分别是什么','Sketch, core and library have different roles','草图是你编辑的程序，通常保存在与主.ino文件同名的文件夹中。板卡核心提供目标芯片的构建与上传支持，库提供某项功能的代码。安装Arduino IDE不等于所有板卡核心已齐全，也不等于传感器库都已安装。先确认目标板完整名称，避免把“ESP32”“Uno”或“STM32”当作可以互换的一个选项。','A sketch is your program, usually in a folder sharing the main .ino filename. A board core supplies target build/upload support; a library supplies feature code. Installing the IDE does not install every core or sensor library. Identify the full board model rather than treating broad names such as ESP32, Uno and STM32 as interchangeable settings.'],
 ['打开示例，再另存为自己的副本','Open an example and save your own copy','在Arduino IDE 2中，从File→Examples选择对应核心的简单示例，使用File→Save As保存到练习目录。本课先用Serial输出，不假设所有板子的内置LED都在同一引脚。写清版本字符串，例如lesson-v1；以后核对上传是否成功就有可识别的证据。示例菜单内容会随已装核心和库改变。','In Arduino IDE 2 choose a simple example from File → Examples, then File → Save As into a practice folder. Begin with Serial output rather than assuming every board uses the same LED pin. Print a version such as lesson-v1 so a later upload can be identified. Available examples depend on installed cores and libraries.'],
 ['在Boards Manager安装正确核心','Install the correct board core','打开左侧Boards Manager或Tools→Board→Boards Manager，搜索板卡所属平台，核对发布者和版本再安装。ESP32使用Espressif官方安装说明中的包索引与esp32平台；不要为了一块ESP32去安装任意名字含ESP的库。记录核心版本，下载失败时区分网络/索引问题与编译问题，安装结束再重新选具体板型。','Open Boards Manager from the sidebar or Tools → Board → Boards Manager. Search the platform, verify publisher/version and install. For ESP32 use Espressif’s documented package index and esp32 platform, not an unrelated library with ESP in its name. Record the core version and distinguish download/index failures from build failures, then select the precise board.'],
 ['板型回答“给谁编译”，端口回答“连到哪里”','Board selects the build target; port selects a connection','使用顶部板卡选择器，必要时打开Select other board and port；也可从Tools→Board和Tools→Port选择。板型决定工具链、引脚定义和上传方法；COM端口只是电脑看到的连接。选中一个COM号并不证明板型正确。没有连接实物时仍可对已安装板型执行Verify，但不能凭这一步宣称已上传。','Use the top board selector and Select other board and port, or Tools → Board / Port. Board selection determines toolchain, pin definitions and upload method; a COM port identifies a detected connection. A selected port does not prove the target is correct. You can Verify for an installed board without hardware, but that is not an upload.'],
 ['USB线、驱动与端口枚举','Check USB data, driver and port enumeration','先用能传数据的USB线连接，观察插入前后新增的端口，再在IDE里选择。只有充电功能的线可让板亮灯却不出现端口。若使用USB转串口芯片，驱动应来自对应芯片/板卡官方来源；原生USB板的端口行为可能不同。不要从灯亮就推断传输链路完整，也不要固定记住别人的COM3。','Use a USB data cable and compare ports before and after connection. A charge-only cable can light the board without creating a data port. USB-serial bridges may need the correct official driver; native-USB boards can behave differently. Power LEDs do not prove data connectivity, and another computer’s COM3 is not a universal port number.'],
 ['库管理器解决功能依赖，不替代核心','Library Manager resolves feature dependencies','从Sketch→Include Library→Manage Libraries或左侧Library Manager搜索准确库名，核对作者、兼容架构和版本。编译提示某个.h不存在时，先确认需要哪个库，而不是复制随机同名头文件。WiFi、SPI、Wire等可能由当前核心提供，名称相同也可能有平台差别。多个同名库冲突时读取编译输出实际选用了哪一个。','Use Sketch → Include Library → Manage Libraries or the sidebar Library Manager. Check exact name, author, supported architecture and version. For a missing .h file, identify its dependency rather than copying a random same-named header. WiFi, SPI and Wire may come with the selected core. When duplicates exist, inspect which library the build actually selected.'],
 ['Verify只证明这一目标的构建','Verify checks the selected build target','点击勾号Verify，等待编译和链接完成。成功消息、程序/内存用量说明当前源码与依赖对所选目标构建成功，不证明接线正确，也不证明另一款板可运行。若失败，从第一条具体error查看缺库、语法、架构或工具问题，保留上下文；不要只截最后的exit status。','Click Verify and wait for compile/link completion. Success and memory usage describe a build for the selected target, not correct wiring or compatibility with another board. On failure read the first concrete error for missing dependencies, syntax, architecture or tool problems. Preserve context instead of only the final exit-status line.'],
 ['Upload还要通过连接与启动条件','Upload also needs the connection and boot state','点击箭头Upload会构建并尝试把程序写入板子。找不到端口、端口被占用和无法与启动加载器同步属于不同失败；先关闭其他占用同一端口的工具，检查板型/端口/线缆，再按该板官方步骤处理BOOT/RESET。不要随意改擦除或安全选项当成修复。上传完成后，板子通常重启执行新程序。','Upload builds and attempts to write the board. A missing port, a busy port and failure to synchronize with the bootloader are different faults. Close conflicting tools, verify target/port/cable, then follow that board’s BOOT/RESET instructions. Do not use erase/security settings as random fixes. A successful upload normally restarts the new program.'],
 ['串口监视器是运行证据','Serial Monitor provides execution evidence','示例setup中调用Serial.begin(115200)，loop周期输出版本或计数。上传后点右上角Serial Monitor，并把波特率设为115200；乱码先核波特率、数据格式和所选端口。需要原生USB CDC设置的板，要按该核心说明启用并确认对应接口；不保证每块板的Serial都映射同一物理UART。串口能看到新版本才是更强的运行证据。','If setup uses Serial.begin(115200), open Serial Monitor after uploading and choose 115200. For garbled text check baud, framing and port. Native-USB CDC settings and the mapping of Serial vary by board/core, so confirm the documented interface. Seeing the new version string provides stronger execution evidence than an upload progress bar.'],
 ['留一份最小复现记录','Keep a minimal reproduction record','将板卡完整型号、核心版本、库名/版本、关键菜单设置、草图和预期串口输出写进README。故障记录按“编译前/编译时/上传时/运行时”分类，附第一条具体错误。本网页训练台不会真的安装核心、枚举USB或烧录；真实板验收要另存实际IDE输出和设备行为。','Record board model, core version, libraries/versions, important menu settings, sketch and expected serial output in a README. Classify faults as before build, during build, during upload or during execution, with the first useful error. The webpage does not install cores, enumerate USB or flash hardware; keep actual IDE/device evidence separately.']
 ],example:['setup执行Serial.begin(115200)；loop每秒Serial.println("lesson-v1")。先选择正确板型，即使未接板也可Verify。随后连接数据线并选择新增端口，Upload成功后打开115200波特的监视器。把文字改为lesson-v2并再次上传；监视器出现v2才证明新程序正在执行。只有Verify成功而仍看到v1，不能算完成更新。','Let setup call Serial.begin(115200) and loop print lesson-v1 once per second. Select the correct target and Verify, even without hardware. Then connect a data cable, select its port, upload and open the monitor at 115200. Change the text to lesson-v2 and upload again; seeing v2 proves the new program is executing. Verify success with v1 still running is not a completed update.'],
 error:['把库当板卡核心；端口存在就忽略板型；灯亮就认为USB能传数据；编译成功就当上传成功；串口乱码时只改源码。','Confusing a library with a core, ignoring board type because a port exists, assuming a lit LED proves USB data, treating Verify as Upload, or rewriting code before checking serial settings.'],
 task:[['从最小串口草图完成一次可识别的版本更新。','Complete an identifiable update using a minimal serial sketch.'],['拔掉板子后哪些步骤仍能做？看到v1但Verify已过，能否证明v2已写入？','Which steps remain possible with the board unplugged? Does a successful Verify prove v2 is installed while v1 still prints?'],['在Arduino IDE训练模式选择核心/板型/端口，完成编译、上传和匹配波特率的串口观察；再各修复一次缺库与错误端口。','In Arduino IDE training choose core/board/port, build, upload and inspect matching-baud output; then repair a missing library and wrong port separately.'],['把成功证据分别标成构建成功、写入成功和新版本运行，说明它们的先后关系。','Label evidence as build success, write success and new-version execution and explain their order.'],['条件具备时用自己的板卡完成相同最小草图，按板卡资料调整Serial接口或LED引脚。','When equipped, repeat with your own board, adapting Serial interface or LED pin from its documentation.'],['保留设置表、最小草图和v1→v2运行证据。','Keep settings, minimal sketch and evidence of v1→v2 execution.'],['能独立区分四类错误，且不会把教学模拟记录当真实上传日志。','Distinguish all four fault stages and keep simulated records separate from actual uploads.']],refs:['board','libraries','serial','detect','espinstall']}
];
COURSE_DATA10.push(
{id:'stlink-swd',title:['ST-Link与SWD：参考电压、连接、下载和调试','ST-Link and SWD: voltage reference, wiring, programming and debug'],pre:['mcu','c-debug','power'],week:55,lab:'connections',wireMode:'swd',
 goal:['根据探针与目标板资料连接SWD，并区分目标供电、逻辑电压参考、下载和串口通信。','Wire SWD from probe/board documentation and distinguish target power, logic reference, programming and serial communication.'],
 sections:[
 ['先认识两端设备','Identify the probe and the target','ST-Link是电脑与目标MCU之间的调试/编程探针，USB接电脑，另一端按支持的接口接目标。SWD是调试通信协议，不是串口TX/RX的别名。板载ST-Link与外置探针都可能使用SWD，但接口位置、跳线和供电方式各不相同；先确认目标是否已有板载调试器，避免把两套驱动同时接到相同信号。','ST-Link is a debug/programming probe between a PC and a target MCU: USB faces the PC and a supported debug interface faces the target. SWD is not another name for UART TX/RX. On-board and external probes may both use SWD but differ in connectors, jumpers and power. Identify any built-in probe before connecting two drivers to the same signals.'],
 ['“两线”指两根信号，还需要参考与供电','Two-wire names signals, not the entire electrical connection','SWDIO是双向调试数据，SWCLK是调试时钟。除此之外要有公共GND，目标必须获得正确供电，探针还可能需要VTref/VAPP目标电压参考。NRST可以提供复位控制，某些连接/恢复方式需要它；SWO是可选跟踪输出，不是最低限度必接的另一根UART TX。每根线的方向与作用都先写清。','SWDIO is bidirectional debug data and SWCLK is debug clock. You also need common ground, correctly powered target circuitry and the probe’s required VTref/VAPP reference. NRST enables reset control and may be needed for certain connection/recovery modes. Optional SWO is trace output, not a required UART transmit wire. Record each signal role before connecting.'],
 ['VTref不是“给板子随便供电”','VTref is not a universal power output','VTref/VAPP通常告诉探针目标I/O工作电压，用来匹配或感知电平。某些探针另有明确的目标供电输出，另一些没有；不能仅凭VCC、3V3丝印决定用途。若目标板USB经稳压器供MCU 3.3 V，参考点通常应是实际目标逻辑电源，而不是USB的5 V。准确方向、范围和引脚编号必须以该探针手册为准。','VTref/VAPP typically tells the probe the target I/O supply level. Some probes have a separate explicit power output; others do not. Labels such as VCC or 3V3 alone do not determine the function. If USB feeds a board regulator producing 3.3 V for the MCU, reference the actual logic rail rather than USB 5 V. Confirm direction, range and pin numbers in that probe manual.'],
 ['断电时先做一张对应表','Make a pin mapping before powering up','按目标板原理图找到SWDIO、SWCLK、GND、目标逻辑电源和NRST，逐项映射到探针同功能引脚。数据线不交叉成SWDIO接SWCLK，也不照串口的TX/RX规则接。目标的MCU管脚号和板上排针编号是两套编号。确认没有把电源短路，也没有两个供电输出硬并联，再按供电方案连接。','Find SWDIO, SWCLK, GND, target logic rail and NRST in the board schematic and map them by function to the probe. Do not cross SWDIO with SWCLK or apply UART TX/RX rules. MCU package pins and board-header positions are different numbering systems. Check for supply shorts and conflicting power outputs before using the planned power arrangement.'],
 ['先连接并读取身份，再写程序','Connect and read identity before writing firmware','在STM32CubeProgrammer等官方工具中选ST-LINK接口，确认正确探针，选SWD连接并设置合适的调试频率，先尝试Connect。成功读取设备ID、目标电压和存储信息属于连接证据；它还没有证明新程序已写入。首次学习应使用可恢复的练习板，先保存现有工程与所需配置，不把“全片擦除”作为默认第一步。','In an official tool such as STM32CubeProgrammer choose ST-LINK, identify the probe, select SWD and an appropriate debug frequency, then Connect. Device ID, voltage and memory information demonstrate connection, not a completed firmware update. Use a recoverable practice board, preserve needed project/configuration data and do not begin with an indiscriminate full-chip erase.'],
 ['写入地址和文件类型要分清','Distinguish file format and programming address','HEX和ELF通常携带地址等信息，裸BIN只是字节流，写入地址必须由具体工程与芯片内存布局确定。不能对所有STM32套一个网上地址，更不能把给另一芯片的文件写进来试运气。选文件、核目标与地址、执行写入和校验，最后复位观察程序版本；校验成功说明所核区域字节一致，不自动证明程序逻辑正确。','HEX and ELF usually carry addressing information; a raw BIN is a byte stream requiring an address from the exact project and memory layout. Do not apply an arbitrary address or another chip’s image universally. Select the image, verify target/address, program and verify, then reset and observe its version. Byte verification does not by itself prove correct program behavior.'],
 ['下载与调试不是同一个按钮效果','Programming and debugging are different capabilities','下载把程序放进非易失存储；调试还能在支持条件下暂停CPU、单步、查看变量和寄存器。源代码级调试需要匹配的可执行文件与调试信息，优化也会改变变量可见性。暂停CPU可能改变实时系统时序，因此本课用无危险执行机构的简单计数例子，不把成功停在断点当成电机控制安全证明。','Programming writes nonvolatile memory. Debugging can additionally halt, step and inspect variables/registers when supported. Source-level debugging requires matching executable/debug information; optimization affects what variables remain visible. Halting changes real-time behavior, so use a simple counter without hazardous actuators and do not equate a working breakpoint with control-system safety.'],
 ['BOOT和RESET分别改变什么','BOOT and RESET do different things','RESET/NRST使芯片复位重新启动；BOOT相关引脚、选项字节或启动配置决定启动来源，具体机制依芯片系列。SWD访问通常不等于先进入UART ROM下载模式，不能把按住BOOT当作一切连接问题的通用答案。若需要系统加载器，要查AN2606的准确器件条目，明确支持的接口、引脚和进入条件。','RESET/NRST restarts the device. BOOT pins, option bytes and other settings select the boot source according to the MCU family. SWD access is not the same as entering a UART ROM loader, so holding BOOT is not a universal fix. For system-loader access, consult the exact AN2606 device entry for supported interfaces, pins and entry conditions.'],
 ['连接失败按证据逐层排查','Troubleshoot connection by layers','先确认电脑识别探针，再确认目标真实供电和VTref读数，再核共地、脚序、连线长度与SWD时钟。若应用占用调试脚或快速进入低功耗，官方支持的Connect under reset可能有帮助，但需要正确NRST连接。读保护、安全配置或芯片损坏不是改一根线就一定能解决；读取错误说明，避免为了连接而随意解锁或擦除已有数据。','First verify PC probe detection, actual target power/reference, common ground, pin mapping, wire length and SWD clock. If application code reconfigures debug pins or enters low power, a supported connect-under-reset mode may help with NRST wired correctly. Protection settings or hardware damage need their own diagnosis; do not randomly unlock or erase data to force a connection.'],
 ['与USB-TTL做一次明确比较','Compare directly with USB-TTL','普通USB-TTL把USB数据变成UART字节流；它没有因为长得像小下载器就自动具备SWD调试能力。某些ST-Link型号另带虚拟串口，但那是另一组功能和引脚，不能把SWDIO插进目标RX来读取日志。记录你实际使用的是SWD下载/调试，还是UART日志/特定启动加载协议，接口和软件必须匹配。','An ordinary USB-TTL bridge converts USB data to UART bytes; its small programmer-like appearance does not give it SWD debugging. Some ST-Link variants also expose a virtual serial port through separate functionality/pins. SWDIO is not a UART log connection to RX. Record whether the task uses SWD programming/debug or UART logging/specific bootloader protocol.']
 ],example:['练习板由自身USB供电，MCU逻辑轨实测3.3 V；假定探针手册明确VTref是输入。连接GND→GND、SWDIO→SWDIO、SWCLK→SWCLK、VTref→目标3.3 V，并按需要NRST→NRST；不把探针另一个电源输出再并到已供电的轨上。软件先读取ID，再写匹配的练习固件并校验，复位后串口或LED显示版本v2。每一步分别记为识别、连接、写入、运行证据。','A practice board powers itself by USB and its MCU rail measures 3.3 V; assume the probe manual defines VTref as an input. Connect GND, SWDIO and SWCLK by matching function, VTref to target 3.3 V and NRST when required. Do not parallel another supply output onto the powered rail. Read ID, program/verify a matching image, then reset and observe v2 by serial output or LED behavior, recording each evidence stage.'],
 error:['把VTref当电源输出；按外壳或线色猜脚序；SWDIO/SWCLK交叉；把BOOT当万能修复；将校验字节成功当程序已正确运行。','Treating VTref as power output, guessing pinout by casing/color, crossing SWD signals, treating BOOT as a universal fix, or confusing byte verification with correct execution.'],
 task:[['给一块独立供电的练习目标建立SWD连接表。','Create an SWD mapping for an independently powered practice target.'],['目标已由USB供电，探针VTref标为输入，还要把探针电源输出接上吗？','The target is USB-powered and probe VTref is an input. Should another probe supply output be connected?'],['在接线台选SWD，按功能连接并设置目标/参考电平，检查后故意移除GND或调错参考电压，再修复。','Select SWD in the wiring trainer, connect by function and set target/reference levels, then remove GND or mismatch reference and repair.'],['解释为何两个调试信号之外还要共地与供电，并列出下载和运行的不同证据。','Explain common ground/power beyond the two debug signals and separate programming from execution evidence.'],['查自己的探针手册，写一张不依赖颜色的真实引脚表；没有实物时停在纸面核对。','Use your probe manual to create a color-independent real pin map; remain at paper verification without hardware.'],['保留功能映射、供电来源、VTref方向与一组故障/修复记录。','Keep function mapping, power source, reference direction and a fault/repair record.'],['不混接电源或UART，能够用证据说明连接失败发生在哪一层。','Avoid power/UART confusion and identify the failed connection layer from evidence.']],refs:['stlink','boot']},
{id:'usb-ttl-uart',title:['USB-TTL与UART：交叉接线、电平、波特率和启动模式','USB-TTL and UART: crossing signals, levels, baud and boot modes'],pre:['logic','protocol','modules-levels','arduino-ide-workflow'],week:67,lab:'connections',wireMode:'uart',
 goal:['按信号方向连接TX/RX/GND，核对供电与逻辑电平，解释串口日志与UART烧录为何不同。','Connect TX/RX/GND by direction, check supply versus logic levels and distinguish serial logging from UART firmware loading.'],
 sections:[
 ['USB-TTL在电脑和板子之间翻译什么','What the USB-UART bridge translates','适配器在电脑侧是USB设备，通常枚举为串口；目标侧输出与接收UART电平信号。它不是把USB的D+/D−直接变成目标的任意引脚，也不是SWD探针。“TTL串口”在商家标题中常泛指逻辑电平UART，实际可能是3.3 V或5 V CMOS/TTL兼容电平；必须查真实电气规格。','The adapter is a USB device on the PC side, usually exposed as a serial port, and UART electrical signals on the target side. It is neither arbitrary USB D+/D− wiring nor an SWD probe. Product labels often use TTL serial loosely for logic-level UART, which may use 3.3 V or 5 V signaling. Check actual electrical specifications.'],
 ['TX与RX按谁在说话命名','TX and RX are named from each device’s viewpoint','TX是本端发送输出，RX是本端接收输入，所以适配器TX接目标RX，适配器RX接目标TX。GND必须提供共同参考。若只看目标启动日志，最小信号方向可能只需要目标TX→适配器RX加GND，但供电仍要正确。不要将两个TX输出直接连接，双方都驱动时会发生冲突。','TX is the local transmit output and RX the local receive input. Connect adapter TX to target RX and adapter RX to target TX, with common ground. Reading boot logs may need only target TX → adapter RX plus GND, while target power remains necessary. Do not connect two actively driven TX outputs together.'],
 ['VCC和I/O电平不能画等号','VCC and I/O signaling voltage are not interchangeable','有的适配器标3.3 V表示信号电平，却仍提供5 V的VCC脚。例如FTDI TTL-232R-3V3官方产品把UART信号标为3.3 V、VCC标为5 V。板上跳帽也可能只切供电输出而不切信号电平。接线前分别写下适配器TX高电平、目标RX允许范围、VCC输出及目标供电来源，不能靠一个3V3标签猜全部。','Some adapters advertise 3.3 V signaling but expose a 5 V VCC pin. FTDI’s TTL-232R-3V3 is an explicit example. A jumper may change power output without changing signal levels. Record adapter TX level, target RX limits, VCC output and target power source separately instead of inferring all four from one 3V3 label.'],
 ['先决定谁给目标供电','Choose the target’s power source first','如果目标由自己的USB或电源供电，通常只连需要的信号和GND，VCC是否连接由目标与适配器资料决定。若确实用适配器供电，要核电压、最大可供电流、板载稳压器输入和启动峰值，不能指望小适配器稳定带ESP32的所有无线瞬态。电平转换解决信号兼容，不替代供电容量。','If the target has its own supply, connect required signals/ground and decide about VCC from the actual documentation. When powering from an adapter, check voltage, output-current rating, regulator input and startup peaks; a small adapter is not automatically an adequate wireless-board supply. Logic translation does not solve insufficient power capacity.'],
 ['UART没有时钟线，靠双方约定节奏','UART has no clock wire and needs matching timing','异步UART靠起始位定位，再按约定波特率采样。常见8N1是一位起始、八位数据、无校验、一位停止，每字符至少10个比特。115200 bit/s时一个连续8N1字符约10/115200=86.8 µs；这不是115200个有效字节每秒。双方还要匹配数据位、校验和停止位，不能只核波特率一个数。','Asynchronous UART detects a start bit and samples at an agreed rate. In 8N1, one start bit, eight data bits and one stop bit make at least ten bits per character. At 115200 bit/s, a continuous character takes about 86.8 µs, not one of 115200 useful bytes each second. Match framing as well as baud.'],
 ['先选端口，再看乱码发生在哪一层','Separate port selection from garbled data','连接适配器后选择新增端口，关闭其他占用该端口的软件，再设目标程序使用的波特率和格式。完全无数据先查目标是否在输出、RX/TX和GND；有稳定乱码先查波特率/格式/电平；偶发错误再查线长、噪声和供电。IDE中的换行选项只影响你发送的行结束符，不会修正错误波特率。','Choose the newly detected adapter port, close conflicting applications and set the target’s baud/framing. For no data, check whether the target transmits and inspect RX/TX/GND. For consistent garbage, check timing/framing/levels; for intermittent errors, examine wiring, noise and power. Terminal line-ending settings change sent terminators, not baud accuracy.'],
 ['日志是字节，烧录还需要协议和启动加载器','Firmware loading needs more than a serial cable','串口日志是应用主动发送的信息。UART烧录则要求目标运行兼容的ROM或软件启动加载器，电脑使用对应协议，且连接的是该加载器支持的UART引脚。适配器能显示日志不等于能够烧录任意芯片；上传软件、芯片型号、BOOT条件和文件布局都要匹配。没有加载器时，普通USB-TTL不能替代SWD。','Logs are bytes emitted by the application. UART flashing requires a compatible ROM/software bootloader, matching host protocol and the UART pins supported by that loader. Reading logs does not prove arbitrary-chip programming capability. Tool, chip, boot entry and image layout must match. Without an appropriate loader, a normal USB-TTL adapter does not replace SWD.'],
 ['BOOT与RESET按具体芯片查','Look up BOOT and RESET for the exact chip','BOOT决定启动配置，RESET或EN使芯片重新启动并采样相关条件。经典ESP32常用GPIO0在复位时的状态进入下载模式，但其他ESP32系列、开发板自动下载电路和STM32系列不应套同一接法。STM32应查AN2606对应条目。不要把BOOT脚当持续的串行数据输入，也不要把RX/TX接到RESET上。','BOOT selects a startup configuration; RESET/EN restarts the chip and applies relevant conditions. Classic ESP32 commonly samples GPIO0 for download mode, but other ESP32 variants, auto-reset circuits and STM32 families need their own instructions. For STM32 consult its AN2606 entry. BOOT is not a serial data pin, and RX/TX do not connect to RESET.'],
 ['TTL UART、RS-232和RS-485不是同一种电气接口','TTL UART, RS-232 and RS-485 differ electrically','同样出现“串口”并不意味着线能直连。逻辑电平UART一般以GND为参考；RS-232使用另一套电压范围与极性；RS-485采用差分收发器。它们可能传输类似字节格式，但电气层不同。需要相应收发器或转换器，不能把带负电压的RS-232线直接插到不耐受的MCU GPIO。','Serial terminology does not establish electrical compatibility. Logic UART references GND, RS-232 uses different voltage/polarity conventions and RS-485 uses differential transceivers. Similar byte framing does not make their wires interchangeable. Use appropriate transceivers rather than connecting RS-232 voltages directly to MCU GPIO.'],
 ['用一次回环和一次目标输出分别验收','Separate adapter loopback from target communication','在确认适配器手册允许的逻辑回环条件下，断开目标，将适配器TX接自己的RX，可用发送/接收验证适配器路径；它不能验证目标板或烧录协议。随后恢复正确目标接线，让目标输出已知版本字符串。记录供电、电平、端口、波特率、格式与实际字节，不以“电脑发现COM口”作为最终成功。','When permitted by the adapter documentation, disconnect the target and loop adapter TX to its own RX to check the adapter path. This does not validate the target or flashing protocol. Restore proper target wiring and request a known version string. Record power, levels, port, baud, framing and bytes; COM-port enumeration is only an early step.']
 ],example:['目标为已独立供电的3.3 V逻辑板，适配器确认TX也是3.3 V：接GND↔GND、适配器TX→目标RX、适配器RX←目标TX，暂不接用途未确认的VCC。目标发送115200 8N1，监视器误设9600会乱码；改115200后才按同一节奏采样。若还想用此线烧录，另查目标加载器支持的引脚、进入条件和协议，不能凭串口日志成功直接推断。','For an independently powered 3.3 V target and verified 3.3 V adapter TX, connect GND, adapter TX→target RX and adapter RX←target TX; leave undocumented VCC disconnected. A target sending 115200 8N1 will be misread at 9600. Matching 115200 fixes timing, not necessarily every fault. Programming through this cable still requires documented loader pins, entry conditions and protocol.'],
 error:['TX接TX；没有共地；把3.3V信号标签当VCC电压；对所有板套BOOT步骤；把回环或日志成功当烧录能力。','TX-to-TX, missing common ground, equating signal labels with VCC, universal BOOT recipes, or treating loopback/log success as programming capability.'],
 task:[['把一个UART“没有输出/乱码”故障分层定位。','Diagnose a no-output/garbled-UART case by layer.'],['目标TX与适配器TX该不该接在一起？8N1的115200波特每字节约耗时多少？','Should target TX connect to adapter TX, and how long does an 8N1 character take at 115200?'],['在UART接线台正确连线并匹配电平/波特率；分别制造TX接错、缺GND和波特不匹配，再检查反馈。','Wire UART with matching levels/baud, then separately introduce TX miswiring, missing GND and baud mismatch and inspect feedback.'],['按供电、电气连接、时序、应用/加载器四层解释故障，不用一个“重装驱动”覆盖全部。','Explain faults at power, wiring, timing and application/loader layers rather than treating reinstalling drivers as a universal fix.'],['查一款真实适配器的VCC与I/O规格，填写它能否直接连接你的目标；无资料的项标未确认。','Read a real adapter’s VCC and I/O specifications and assess your target; mark undocumented items unverified.'],['保存交叉连接图、规格核对表和三项故障修复记录。','Keep crossed-signal mapping, specification checks and three fault/repair records.'],['能明确电源与信号电平差别，且不把UART与SWD或RS-232混接。','Explain power versus signaling level and avoid mixing UART, SWD and RS-232.']],refs:['ttl','boot','serial']},
{id:'spi-wiring',title:['SPI从零开始：时钟、双向数据、片选与模式','SPI from zero: clock, data paths, chip select and modes'],pre:['protocol','logic','modules-levels'],week:69,lab:'connections',wireMode:'spi',
 goal:['正确连接常见四线SPI，按外设资料选择片选和CPOL/CPHA，并区分物理接线与寄存器协议。','Wire common four-signal SPI, select chip select and CPOL/CPHA from the peripheral datasheet and separate wiring from register protocol.'],
 sections:[
 ['为什么SPI多了一根时钟','Why SPI has an explicit clock','SPI是同步串行接口，由控制器提供SCK/SCLK节奏，让发送与接收按时钟边沿进行。常见四信号模式有SCK、控制器输出数据、控制器输入数据和片选CS；供电与GND不包含在“四线”这个信号计数里。SPI不像UART那样只靠双方独立波特时钟，也没有I²C通用的地址仲裁规则。','SPI is synchronous: a controller supplies SCK/SCLK edges for transmission and sampling. Common four-signal SPI uses clock, controller data out, controller data in and CS. Power and GND are additional connections. Unlike UART it has an explicit clock, and it does not use I2C’s general addressing/arbitration rules.'],
 ['MOSI/MISO与COPI/CIPO怎样对应','Map MOSI/MISO and COPI/CIPO by direction','传统MOSI相当于COPI：控制器输出、外设输入；MISO相当于CIPO：外设输出、控制器输入。器件也可能写SDI/SDO，这两个名称通常从器件自身视角命名，所以要查方向。不能只因接口都叫串行，就套UART的“同名TX互换”记忆；本课始终按谁输出、谁输入来画箭头。','Traditional MOSI corresponds to COPI, controller output/peripheral input; MISO corresponds to CIPO, the opposite direction. SDI/SDO labels are often from the local device’s perspective, so verify direction. Do not transfer UART naming shortcuts blindly. Draw an arrow from each output to the intended input.'],
 ['先连共同参考，再逐根核功能','Establish reference and map each function','目标独立供电且电平匹配时，连接共同GND、SCK→SCK、控制器MOSI→外设SDI、外设SDO→控制器MISO，再用GPIO→外设CS。板上排针标号与MCU复用引脚不一定相同，库默认SPI引脚也可能因板型变化。先在板卡引脚图确认可用的SPI实例和实际布线，避免把另一块板的针号直接照搬。','For a separately powered, level-compatible target, connect GND, SCK, controller MOSI→peripheral SDI, peripheral SDO→controller MISO and a GPIO→CS. Header numbering, MCU alternate functions and library default pins can differ by board. Confirm the chosen SPI peripheral instance and actual pin map instead of copying another board’s pin numbers.'],
 ['CS选择谁响应，不是装饰线','CS determines which peripheral responds','许多SPI器件以低电平CS有效，但必须看手册。有两个外设共享SCK/MOSI/MISO时，通常各有独立CS，未选中的外设应按规格释放输出。若同时选中两个会驱动MISO的器件，就可能争用总线。部分器件支持串接等特殊模式，不能把常见独立片选规则当作所有SPI的唯一结构。','Many peripherals use active-low CS, but verify it. Two devices sharing SCK/MOSI/MISO typically have separate CS signals and unselected outputs must release the line as specified. Selecting two driving MISO outputs can cause contention. Daisy chains and other arrangements exist, so the common separate-CS structure is not universal.'],
 ['CPOL与CPHA决定看哪一个边沿','CPOL and CPHA select timing edges','CPOL决定空闲时SCK高或低；CPHA决定在首个还是第二个有效边沿采样。常见模式0是CPOL=0、CPHA=0，空闲低，首个上升沿采样；模式3是CPOL=1、CPHA=1，空闲高，第二个上升沿采样。不要凭“都有时钟”就认为会读对；控制器设置必须符合外设的时序图与建立/保持要求。','CPOL selects the idle clock level; CPHA selects first- or second-edge sampling. In common mode 0, clock idles low and sampling uses the first rising edge; mode 3 idles high and uses the second, rising edge. Clock activity alone does not establish correct sampling. Match the peripheral timing diagram and setup/hold requirements.'],
 ['发送一个字节时，也会移入一个字节','Clocking a byte also shifts incoming data','常见全双工SPI每产生一组时钟，发送与接收同时移位。要读外设数据，控制器常需发送规定的命令或占位字节以产生时钟；收到的第一个字节可能是状态或无效值，取决于器件协议。看到transfer函数返回一个数，并不证明该数就是传感器测量值；必须知道命令、地址、数据长度与位序。','In common full-duplex SPI, each clock sequence shifts outgoing and incoming bits together. Reading often requires sending a command or dummy byte to generate clocks. The first received byte may be status or invalid data depending on the device. A transfer return value is not automatically a measurement: command, address, length and bit order matter.'],
 ['速度不是越快越好','Use a supported clock rather than maximum speed','先选低于器件额定上限、便于观察的时钟，例如教学例子的100 kHz，再逐步验证。1 MHz时一个8位字节仅时钟部分约8 µs，但片选建立/保持、命令间隙和软件开销另算。线长、地回路、边沿速度与电平转换会限制真实可靠性；不能从字节时间推导整个采集系统必定达到同样吞吐率。','Begin at a supported, observable clock such as the example’s 100 kHz, then validate changes. At 1 MHz, eight clocks take 8 µs, excluding CS setup/hold, inter-command gaps and software overhead. Wiring, return paths, edge rates and level translation affect reliability. Byte clock time is not a guarantee of system sampling throughput.'],
 ['SPI不靠I²C式上拉完成常规数据输出','SPI signaling is not ordinary I2C open-drain signaling','常见SPI数据/时钟由推挽输出驱动高低，不能把I²C必须上拉的规则原样套过来。某些CS需要电阻保证复位时不误选中，某些输出需按规格配置，但这与给SDA/SCL建立高电平是不同目的。5 V输出接3.3 V非耐受输入仍需兼容方案，SPI这个协议名称不会自动保证电气安全。','Common SPI clock/data outputs actively drive high and low, unlike ordinary I2C open-drain signaling. A CS bias resistor may establish an unselected reset state, which is a different purpose from I2C pull-ups. A 5 V output still requires a compatible path to a non-tolerant 3.3 V input; protocol naming does not ensure electrical compatibility.'],
 ['全是0或全是1时怎样排查','Diagnose all-zero or all-one reads','先核外设供电、GND和实际CS是否有效；再看SCK是否出现，MOSI命令方向、MISO是否连到正确输入。全1可能来自浮空/上拉或未选中，不能直接断言芯片坏；全0也可能是接地、无供电、模式或命令错误。用器件ID寄存器等已知值做最小验证，再接入复杂传感器算法。','Check power, ground and active CS first, then clock activity, command direction and the MISO input. All ones may reflect an unselected or biased/floating line, not a dead chip; all zeros can have wiring, power, mode or command causes. Verify a documented device-ID or other known register before adding complex measurement code.'],
 ['与I²C比较，按任务选接口','Compare SPI with I2C for the task','SPI通常用片选区分外设、数据线可双向同时传输，更多外设常消耗更多CS引脚。普通I²C用共享SDA/SCL与地址，依赖上拉且有ACK。SPI没有统一的寄存器命令格式，I²C也不保证所有同地址传感器能共存。选择时看实际芯片支持、速度、布线、引脚预算与软件协议，不能只用“SPI快”三个字决定。','SPI commonly selects devices with CS and supports simultaneous data directions, often adding CS pins per peripheral. Ordinary I2C shares addressed SDA/SCL, uses pull-ups and acknowledges bytes. SPI register commands are not universal, while same-address I2C devices cannot automatically coexist. Choose from actual device support, timing, wiring, pin budget and software protocol.']
 ],example:['假想传感器手册规定模式0、最高2 MHz、MSB先发、CS低期间先发0x80再读一个字节。初学先用100 kHz：拉低CS，发送0x80，再发送一个占位字节产生8个读时钟，读取第二次返回值，最后拉高CS。两字节共有16个时钟，时钟部分16/100000=160 µs；首字节返回内容不能未经规定就当测量值。这是明确假设的协议练习，不是所有传感器通用命令。','Assume a sensor specifies mode 0, maximum 2 MHz, MSB-first and command 0x80 followed by one read byte while CS is low. Begin at 100 kHz: assert CS, send 0x80, send a dummy byte for eight read clocks, use the second return value, then release CS. Sixteen clocks take 160 µs, excluding overhead. This is a stated hypothetical protocol, not a universal sensor command.'],
 error:['漏接CS或GND；按名字而不是方向接SDI/SDO；CPOL/CPHA错误；把首个返回字节必然当数据；对所有器件使用同一命令。','Missing CS/GND, mapping SDI/SDO by name without direction, wrong CPOL/CPHA, assuming the first return byte is data or using one command for every device.'],
 task:[['把一条SPI链路从引脚映射走到已知命令时序。','Trace an SPI link from pin mapping to a known command sequence.'],['外设未被片选时，就算SCK在跳变，为什么可能没有有效返回？','Why may there be no valid response even with clock edges when the peripheral is unselected?'],['在SPI接线台接好时钟、两条数据、CS与GND，检查片选状态；随后对比未选中与有效选中。','Connect clock, both data directions, CS and GND in the SPI trainer; compare unselected and selected conditions.'],['用箭头解释两条数据方向，并画出例子的CS与16个时钟。','Explain both data directions and draw the example’s CS interval and sixteen clocks.'],['找一份真实外设手册，记录模式、最大时钟、位序和一个已知寄存器的读命令。','Read a real peripheral datasheet and record mode, maximum clock, bit order and a known-register read command.'],['提交接线表、时序图和实际手册参数；课堂假想命令单独标注。','Submit wiring, timing and actual datasheet parameters, labeling the hypothetical command separately.'],['方向与片选正确，能区分接线通路成功和寄存器协议正确。','Map directions/CS correctly and distinguish an electrical link from a correct register transaction.']],refs:['spi']},
{id:'i2c-wiring',title:['I²C从零开始：SDA/SCL、上拉、地址与ACK','I2C from zero: SDA/SCL, pull-ups, addresses and ACK'],pre:['protocol','modules-levels','capacitor-foundation','spi-wiring'],week:71,lab:'connections',wireMode:'i2c',
 goal:['解释开漏与上拉，使用正确的7位地址，排查无ACK、地址冲突和上升沿过慢。','Explain open-drain/pull-up behavior, use seven-bit addresses and diagnose missing ACK, address conflicts and slow rise times.'],
 sections:[
 ['两根共享信号，还要共同地与供电','Two shared signals still need ground and power','普通I²C使用SDA数据线与SCL时钟线，多器件可共享这两根线，但每个器件仍需合适供电和共同参考。名称有SDA/SCL不代表引脚耐压或默认GPIO一致；查板型与外设资料后再映射。它与SPI不同，常见设备通过地址被选择，不为每一个设备单独增加CS线。','Ordinary I2C uses shared SDA data and SCL clock, while each device still needs suitable power and a common reference. SDA/SCL labels do not establish voltage tolerance or default GPIO mappings. Verify board/peripheral documentation. Unlike typical SPI, devices are commonly selected by address rather than a separate CS per device.'],
 ['开漏只主动拉低，高电平靠上拉','Open-drain actively pulls low; pull-ups restore high','普通双向I²C设备通常主动把线拉到低电平，释放后由上拉电阻将线拉高。多个设备同时拉低不会像两个推挽输出一高一低那样直接对打。没有上拉时，释放不等于得到可靠高电平；线可能浮动。SDA和SCL都要按适用模式/器件配置合适上拉，不能只给数据线装一只。','Ordinary bidirectional I2C devices pull a line low and release it for a pull-up resistor to restore high. Multiple low drivers do not oppose a high-driving push-pull output in the same way. Without pull-ups, release does not create a reliable high. Both SDA and SCL need appropriate pull-ups for the applicable mode/devices.'],
 ['上拉到哪个电源必须核耐压','Choose a compatible pull-up rail','上拉电压决定释放后的总线高电平，所以不能把3.3 V器件的SDA/SCL随手上拉到5 V。一个模块的VCC输入可接受5 V，不自动意味着其I²C引脚可承受5 V；模块可能有稳压而没有电平转换。混合电压时用适合开漏双向总线的转换方案，并检查各侧上拉与掉电条件。','Pull-up voltage sets the released bus-high level, so do not casually pull a 3.3 V device’s lines to 5 V. A module accepting 5 V power may contain regulation without signal translation. Mixed-voltage systems need a suitable bidirectional open-drain translation arrangement and checks of both sides’ pull-ups and unpowered behavior.'],
 ['多个模块上的上拉会并联','Pull-ups on several modules combine in parallel','不少模块已经装了上拉电阻，再接一块会把等效电阻减小。两只4.7 kΩ并联约2.35 kΩ；四只则约1.175 kΩ。更小的电阻让上升沿更快，却增大拉低时器件必须吸收的电流。先查模块原理图或断电测量，不能看到总线不稳就不断追加小电阻。','Modules often include pull-ups, which combine in parallel. Two 4.7 kΩ resistors give about 2.35 kΩ, four about 1.175 kΩ. Lower resistance speeds rising edges but increases the current a device must sink low. Inspect schematics or measure unpowered before repeatedly adding stronger pull-ups to an unstable bus.'],
 ['RC上升沿决定上拉不能太大','RC rise time limits how weak a pull-up can be','导线、连接与引脚形成总线电容Cb。普通RC近似下，30%到70%电平的上升时间tr≈0.8473RpCb。若Cb=100 pF、Rp=10 kΩ，tr≈847 ns；它可能符合100 kbit/s标准模式的1000 ns上升时间上限，却不符合400 kbit/s快速模式的300 ns上限。实际还需检查全部电气时序，不是算对这一项就能保证通信。','Wires, connections and pins contribute bus capacitance Cb. In a simple RC approximation, 30%-to-70% rise time is tr≈0.8473RpCb. With 100 pF and 10 kΩ it is about 847 ns: potentially within the Standard-mode 1000 ns rise-time limit but outside Fast-mode’s 300 ns. This single calculation does not establish compliance with all timing/electrical requirements.'],
 ['上拉也不能无限小','Pull-ups cannot be arbitrarily strong','器件拉低时必须吸收约(Vpull−VOL)/Rp的电流。假定3.3 V上拉、VOL=0.4 V、Rp=2.2 kΩ，则约1.32 mA；是否允许要查最弱器件的低电平驱动能力。结合上升时间给出的最大Rp与吸电流给出的最小Rp，才能选范围。如果两项没有重叠，可能要减小总线电容、降速或改总线结构。','A low-driving device must sink about (Vpull−VOL)/Rp. At 3.3 V, assumed VOL=0.4 V and 2.2 kΩ, this is about 1.32 mA. Check the weakest device’s low-level drive specification. Combine the rise-time maximum resistance with the sink-current minimum. If no range remains, reduce capacitance, lower speed or revise the bus arrangement.'],
 ['7位地址与带读写位的字节别混用','Do not confuse a seven-bit address with the address byte','假设某器件7位地址0x3C，总线上的写地址字节为(0x3C<<1)|0=0x78，读地址字节为0x79。多数接受7位地址的高级API应传0x3C，而不是已经左移的0x78。不同文档可能用不同表示法，先看库参数定义和手册。地址冲突不能靠把代码里一个设备的地址随便改掉解决，硬件设备也必须支持改变地址。','For hypothetical seven-bit address 0x3C, the transmitted write-address byte is 0x78 and read-address byte 0x79. A high-level API expecting seven bits should receive 0x3C, not the shifted byte. Check both API and datasheet conventions. Changing a number in code does not change a physical device’s address unless its hardware/configuration supports that change.'],
 ['ACK说明谁在什么时候响应','Understand the purpose and timing of ACK','每传8位后第9个时钟用于ACK/NACK：接收方在规定时刻拉低SDA表示ACK。地址ACK说明有设备响应这个地址，不证明后续寄存器命令与数据一定正确。读操作结束时控制器通常用NACK结束所需数据，再发STOP；NACK并非在每种情形下都是故障。扫描器也只完成有限的地址探测，不识别全部器件功能。','After eight bits, a ninth clock carries ACK/NACK; the receiver pulls SDA low for ACK. An address ACK shows a responder, not necessarily a correct register command or payload. A controller commonly NACKs the final requested read byte before STOP, so NACK is not always a fault. A scanner performs limited address probing, not full device identification.'],
 ['START、STOP与重复起始','START, STOP and repeated START','普通I²C中，SCL高时SDA从高到低表示START，从低到高表示STOP；数据通常在SCL低时改变，并在高期间保持稳定。某些寄存器读取先写寄存器地址，再用重复START切换读方向而不中断事务。不能把任意两次独立写读当成等价操作；还要看器件是否支持时钟拉伸和具体命令流程。','In ordinary I2C, SDA falling while SCL is high signals START; rising signals STOP. Data normally changes while SCL is low and stays stable while high. Some register reads write a register index, then use repeated START to change direction. Two unrelated transactions may not be equivalent; device-specific sequence and clock-stretching support matter.'],
 ['没有ACK时的检查顺序','Use a systematic missing-ACK checklist','先核供电与GND、SDA/SCL是否互换、上拉电压与电阻，再核7位地址、地址选择脚和时钟速度。检查是否有器件持续拉低总线，或两个相同地址设备同时响应。若地址能ACK但数据不对，再查寄存器地址、重复START、字节序与启动等待时间。网页检查是条件模型，不测量真实上升沿或焊点可靠性。','Check power/ground, swapped SDA/SCL, pull-up rail/resistance, seven-bit address, address-select pins and clock rate. Look for a device holding the bus low or duplicate addresses. If the address acknowledges but data is wrong, examine registers, repeated START, byte order and startup delay. The trainer checks modeled conditions; it does not measure real edges or solder reliability.']
 ],example:['假定3.3 V、100 pF总线，只有两只分别用于SDA/SCL的2.2 kΩ上拉，器件可吸收本例1.32 mA：tr≈0.8473×2200×100×10⁻¹²=186 ns。对于快速模式300 ns上升时间这一项有余量，但仍需核其他时序。目标7位地址0x3C时API填0x3C，线上的写/读地址字节才是0x78/0x79。再接一个同地址且不可改地址的器件，会有地址冲突，不能靠把第二个API地址写成0x3D修复。','Assume a 3.3 V, 100 pF bus with one 2.2 kΩ pull-up per line and devices able to sink the example’s 1.32 mA. Rise time is about 186 ns, below the Fast-mode 300 ns limit for that requirement alone. For target address 0x3C, pass 0x3C to a seven-bit API; transmitted write/read address bytes are 0x78/0x79. A second fixed-address 0x3C device creates a conflict that changing a software constant to 0x3D cannot fix.'],
 error:['遗漏上拉或上拉到错误电压；多个模块并联上拉却不重算；把8位地址字节传给7位API；扫描到地址就认为寄存器协议正确。','Missing/wrong-voltage pull-ups, ignoring parallel module pull-ups, passing an address byte to a seven-bit API or treating a scan response as a verified register protocol.'],
 task:[['建立一个电平、上拉与地址都一致的I²C链路。','Build an I2C link with compatible levels, pull-ups and addressing.'],['0x3C与0x78分别表示什么？10 kΩ上拉与100 pF能否满足300 ns的上升时间要求？','What do 0x3C and 0x78 represent, and can 10 kΩ with 100 pF meet a 300 ns rise-time requirement?'],['在I²C台连接SDA/SCL/GND，设置兼容上拉与地址；比较无上拉、地址冲突和正确条件下的反馈。','Connect SDA/SCL/GND with compatible pull-ups/address and compare missing-pull-up, conflicting-address and valid cases.'],['用RC估算与低电平吸电流两个条件解释上拉选择，再说明ACK证明了什么。','Explain pull-up choice from rise time and sink current, then state what an ACK proves.'],['查一份模块原理图，数清已有上拉并核对地址表示法；推导加入第二模块后的等效电阻。','Inspect a module schematic for existing pull-ups/address convention and calculate equivalent resistance after adding another module.'],['保存上拉计算、7位/总线地址对照和故障修复表。','Keep pull-up calculations, address representations and a fault/repair table.'],['上拉两端限制都检查，地址与API约定一致，并明确网页未测真实信号完整性。','Check both pull-up constraints and API address convention while acknowledging that the webpage does not measure signal integrity.']],refs:['i2c','spi']}
);

COURSE_DATA10.push(
{id:'esp32-arduino-ota',title:['ESP32 Arduino OTA：第一次USB，到网络更新','ESP32 Arduino OTA: first USB provisioning to network updates'],pre:['arduino-ide-workflow','esp-net','usb-ttl-uart'],week:79,tool:'esp32-ota',
 goal:['先用USB装入具备OTA能力的固件，再通过受控网络更新并核对新版本，区分发现、认证、传输与运行。','Provision OTA-capable firmware over USB, update on a controlled network and distinguish discovery, authentication, transfer and execution.'],
 sections:[
 ['OTA不是空白芯片自带的万能入口','OTA is not a universal entry point on a blank chip','OTA是Over-The-Air更新：设备运行中的软件通过网络取得新固件并交给更新机制。ArduinoOTA是Arduino-ESP32提供的一种开发更新方式，不是ESP-IDF HTTPS OTA流程的另一个按钮。第一次必须先让设备拥有正确分区、网络连接和OTA服务；新手通常从USB上传官方BasicOTA示例开始，不能对空白或不含OTA代码的设备直接选择网络上传。','OTA updates use running device software to receive new firmware over a network. ArduinoOTA is an Arduino-ESP32 development workflow, not merely another button for ESP-IDF HTTPS OTA. The device first needs suitable partitions, networking and an OTA service. Beginners normally provision the official BasicOTA example by USB; a blank device or non-OTA firmware cannot receive that workflow automatically.'],
 ['准备板型、核心与可容纳OTA的分区','Prepare the target, core and OTA-capable layout','先记录具体ESP32系列/开发板、Arduino-ESP32核心版本、Flash容量和IDE设置。选择支持OTA的分区方案，并确认新应用能装入一个应用槽；总Flash有空闲不等于目标OTA槽足够大。不同板卡菜单不同，不能凭别人截图选“Huge APP”后假定仍有OTA空间。首次改变分区布局通常要按该板/核心的本地烧录流程处理，不靠普通应用OTA任意重排。','Record ESP32 variant/board, Arduino-ESP32 core version, flash size and IDE settings. Choose an OTA-capable partition layout and ensure the application fits one target slot; total free flash is not the same as slot capacity. Menu names vary, and a huge-application scheme may sacrifice OTA. Establish layout through the documented local provisioning workflow rather than assuming normal application OTA can rearrange it.'],
 ['从官方示例入口开始，先另存','Start from the installed official example','安装正确核心后，在File→Examples→ArduinoOTA中打开BasicOTA，并另存为自己的练习工程。以已安装版本的示例和说明为准，公开仓库master可能比本机版本新。阅读WiFi连接、ArduinoOTA.begin和loop中的ArduinoOTA.handle分别在哪里；不要仅复制一句include就认为设备已经具备完整更新服务。','After installing the correct core, open File → Examples → ArduinoOTA → BasicOTA and save a practice copy. Follow the example for your installed version; the public master branch may be newer. Locate Wi-Fi connection, ArduinoOTA.begin and ArduinoOTA.handle in loop. A header include alone does not create a complete update service.'],
 ['网络凭据只在自己的本地工程填写','Keep actual network credentials in the local project','在自己的本地工程填可用于实验的网络名和口令，使用受控网络与明确设备。共享的课程截图、上传包和日志不要包含真实Wi-Fi口令或OTA口令；本网页模拟无需输入真实凭据。SSID相同不总代表设备彼此可达，访客隔离、VLAN或防火墙策略可能阻断通信。应核网络条件，而不是直接关闭全部安全设置。','Enter actual lab network credentials only in your local project and use a controlled network/device. Exclude real Wi-Fi/OTA passwords from shared screenshots, packages and logs; the webpage simulation does not need them. Matching SSIDs do not guarantee reachability because guest isolation, VLANs or firewall policies may separate clients. Diagnose network conditions rather than disabling all protection.'],
 ['第一次通过USB把服务装进去','Use USB for initial provisioning','选择正确板型与USB串口，Verify之后执行Upload。打开示例设定波特率的串口监视器，等待设备报告已联网、IP或服务就绪状态。先证明这一份初始固件正在运行，必要时按该板官方BOOT/RESET步骤处理下载。只有USB烧录进度完成但设备没有联网，后续网络上传仍然没有条件。','Select the correct board and USB serial port, Verify and Upload. Open Serial Monitor at the example’s baud and wait for network/IP/service-ready evidence. Prove the initial firmware is running, using board-specific BOOT/RESET steps when needed. A completed USB write without a functioning network connection does not establish readiness for network uploading.'],
 ['发现网络端口不等于验证整个更新链','Discovery is only one part of readiness','设备服务启动后，IDE可能在端口列表显示网络目标或主机名；发现通常涉及mDNS与网络可达性，具体随工具/核心版本变化。若没出现，先核设备串口IP、所在网络、发现服务和防火墙对应规则。不要把USB COM号与网络目标混选；记录你这次采用的是USB还是OTA路径。','After the service starts, the IDE may show a network target/hostname. Discovery commonly involves mDNS and reachability, with details varying by tool/core version. If absent, check the device-reported IP, network, discovery service and relevant firewall rules. Distinguish a USB COM port from the network target and record which update path is used.'],
 ['OTA服务要持续获得运行机会','The OTA service must keep being serviced','ArduinoOTA.begin负责初始化服务，ArduinoOTA.handle需要在运行中经常得到调用。若loop里长时间阻塞、不断复位或无线连接掉线，设备即使一度被发现也可能无法完成更新。实验版本先保持简单，用非阻塞或短任务让服务正常运行；新固件也要保留需要的OTA功能，否则这次更新后可能只能回到USB恢复。','ArduinoOTA.begin initializes the service and ArduinoOTA.handle needs regular execution. Long blocking work, repeated resets or lost connectivity can prevent updates even after discovery. Keep the initial experiment simple and service the updater regularly. Preserve OTA capability in the replacement firmware if future network updates are required, or USB recovery may be needed afterward.'],
 ['上传v2后，用设备输出证明它已运行','Verify v2 through device behavior after uploading','把可观察版本字符串从v1改成v2，保存、编译，再选择网络目标发起上传，按配置提供OTA口令。进度到100%仅是某一阶段完成；还要观察重启与新版本输出，必要时重新打开对应串口/网络日志。对比Flash槽大小和编译产物大小，失败时不要把反复重试当作增加可用空间。','Change a visible version string from v1 to v2, save/build, choose the network target and upload with the configured OTA password. A 100% indicator marks one stage; also verify restart and the new version through device output. Compare firmware size to the actual slot size. Repeating a failed upload cannot create additional flash capacity.'],
 ['按错误阶段处理，不凭感觉改代码','Diagnose the failed update stage','发现失败先查网络与服务；认证失败核口令与双方工具版本；传输失败核链路、服务是否持续运行与供电；结束校验失败核镜像、目标与空间；重启后仍旧版本或无输出则查运行/启动证据。若新固件不再启动OTA服务，使用事先保留的USB恢复路径；不要认为所有ArduinoOTA工程默认具备已验证的健康回滚。','Discovery faults point to network/service; authentication faults to password/tool compatibility; transfer faults to connection, service execution and power; completion/validation faults to image, target and space. Old/no output after restart requires boot/runtime evidence. Retain USB recovery if new firmware no longer serves OTA. Do not assume every ArduinoOTA project has validated health rollback enabled.'],
 ['口令、加密、签名和回滚是不同层','Passwords, transport protection, signing and rollback differ','ArduinoOTA可配置认证口令，但不能仅因为出现口令框就宣称传输已具有TLS保密性、固件可信签名或自动健康回滚。认证实现会随核心版本变化，应读所用版本资料。开发网络更新适合受控实验；面向部署的设备还需规划可信固件来源、身份验证、传输保护、断电恢复与回滚策略，下一课用ESP-IDF把这些层次拆开。','An ArduinoOTA password does not by itself establish TLS confidentiality, signed-image authenticity or automatic health rollback. Authentication details can change with the installed core version. Controlled development updates need a different assurance level from deployed devices, which require deliberate firmware trust, identity, transport protection, power-loss recovery and rollback design. The next lesson separates these layers in ESP-IDF.']
 ],example:['设备初始运行v1，具备网络连接和OTA服务，目标应用槽假定为1 MiB。v2镜像为700 KiB，容量检查仅说明它可能放得下，还需目标/镜像校验。选择网络目标并上传后，记录传输完成、重启、设备输出v2三个事件。若v3镜像为1.1 MiB，即使芯片总Flash为4 MiB，也超过此槽，不能靠重试成功。这里的容量是明确假设，不代表你的板卡默认分区。','Assume v1 has networking/OTA and a 1 MiB target app slot. A 700 KiB v2 image passes the size check only; target/image checks still apply. Record transfer completion, restart and device-reported v2 separately. A 1.1 MiB v3 image exceeds this slot even on a 4 MiB flash chip; retries cannot fix it. These capacities are explicit example assumptions, not a default board layout.'],
 error:['空白板直接网络上传；新固件漏掉OTA.handle；只看同SSID或100%进度；把OTA口令当作完整安全方案；假定默认具备健康回滚。','Network uploading to an unprovisioned board, omitting OTA servicing in the replacement, relying only on SSID/progress, treating a password as a complete security design or assuming health rollback by default.'],
 task:[['完成从第一次USB安装到网络v2更新的证据链。','Build the evidence chain from initial USB provisioning to a network v2 update.'],['v1没有OTA服务、或v2大于目标槽，网络再好能更新吗？','Can excellent connectivity update a v1 without an OTA service or fit v2 into an undersized slot?'],['在OTA训练区先选Arduino流程，完成USB初始安装、网络就绪、目标选择与更新；分别验证服务缺失、空间不足与认证失败。','In the Arduino OTA trainer provision by USB, establish network readiness, select the target and update; test missing service, insufficient space and authentication failure separately.'],['标出发现、认证、传输、校验、重启和版本确认各阶段，说明哪一步提供了运行证据。','Label discovery, authentication, transfer, validation, restart and version confirmation and identify execution evidence.'],['有合适设备时，按本机核心的官方BasicOTA例子在受控网络重做，保留USB恢复；分享记录前移除真实凭据。','When equipped, repeat with your installed core’s BasicOTA on a controlled network, retaining USB recovery and removing real credentials from shared records.'],['保存核心/板型/分区条件、v1→v2阶段表和一次故障修复，不保存真实密码。','Keep core/board/layout conditions, the v1→v2 stage table and a fault repair, without real passwords.'],['能指出网络可见、上传完成和新固件运行的差别，且不会承诺未配置的安全/回滚功能。','Distinguish visibility, completed upload and execution without claiming unconfigured security or rollback.']],refs:['espinstall','arduinoota','partitions','idfota']},
{id:'esp32-idf-ota',title:['ESP-IDF OTA：双槽、校验、健康确认与回滚','ESP-IDF OTA: dual slots, validation, health checks and rollback'],pre:['esp32-arduino-ota','c-state','linux-packages'],week:81,tool:'esp32-ota',
 goal:['追踪应用从非活动槽写入到试启动/确认的状态，解释失败回滚前提与传输、签名、反回滚的区别。','Track an app from inactive-slot writing to trial boot/confirmation and explain rollback prerequisites, transport security, signing and anti-rollback.'],
 sections:[
 ['从Arduino操作流程转到固件生命周期','Move from an upload workflow to a firmware lifecycle','ESP-IDF是Espressif的开发框架。OTA功能仍由运行的应用、分区表和启动加载器协作完成，换成IDF不代表自动获得可靠更新。本课只讨论普通应用OTA，初始本地烧录先建立相容布局；启动加载器、分区表、数据分区的更新属于不同风险与支持范围，不能把应用双槽的结论直接推广给它们。','ESP-IDF is Espressif’s framework. OTA still depends on the running app, partition table and bootloader; using IDF alone does not guarantee reliable updates. This lesson concerns ordinary application OTA after compatible local provisioning. Bootloader, partition-table and data-partition updates have distinct support/risk characteristics and do not automatically inherit the same dual-app-slot properties.'],
 ['ota_0、ota_1与otadata各放什么','Know what app slots and otadata contain','常见应用OTA布局至少有两个可交替使用的应用槽，例如ota_0和ota_1，以及OTA数据分区otadata。槽里放应用镜像；otadata帮助启动加载器选择启动应用并记录相关状态。factory分区可以存在，但并非每种布局都必须有。两个槽都要能容纳对应镜像，名字相似不表示它们自动具备相同大小或内容。','A common app-OTA layout has at least two alternating application slots, such as ota_0 and ota_1, plus otadata. Slots hold application images; otadata supports boot selection/state. A factory partition is optional in some layouts. Each destination slot must fit its image; similar names do not prove equal sizes or valid contents.'],
 ['先看实际分区表，再选非活动目标','Inspect the actual table and choose an inactive destination','在已配置好的ESP-IDF项目中确认芯片target与Flash容量，使用menuconfig的Partition Table设置核对布局，或检查项目CSV。运行应用应通过框架接口找到合适的下一OTA分区，而不是硬编码一个网上地址。当前正在运行的槽与下一次准备启动的槽是不同概念；写入时不要覆盖正在运行的唯一可用应用。','In a configured IDF project verify chip target/flash size and inspect Partition Table settings in menuconfig or the project CSV. Use framework APIs to find a suitable next OTA partition rather than hard-coding an internet address. The running slot and the selected next-boot slot are distinct. Avoid overwriting the only valid running image during download.'],
 ['接收、写入、结束校验、选择启动依次进行','Receive, write, validate and select boot in order','底层常见流程是选择目标分区→esp_ota_begin→多次esp_ota_write→esp_ota_end校验→esp_ota_set_boot_partition→esp_restart。每一步检查返回值，失败则保留当前可运行版本，不直接跳到重启。使用esp_https_ota时框架封装了部分下载与写入流程，但仍需检查结果、处理诊断并设计后续健康确认。','A common lower-level flow selects a partition, calls esp_ota_begin, writes chunks with esp_ota_write, validates with esp_ota_end, selects boot with esp_ota_set_boot_partition and restarts. Check every result; failure should retain the working version instead of blindly rebooting. esp_https_ota wraps parts of download/write handling, but result checks and health policy remain necessary.'],
 ['镜像校验不等于应用功能正确','Image validation is not application health','格式、目标芯片、长度、校验或签名检查能拒绝不合适镜像，却不能证明传感器能读、配置能迁移、网络能恢复。即使文件字节完全正确，代码也可能启动后崩溃。把“下载校验完成”和“新应用通过健康检查”分成两个状态，保留能够返回的旧版本及可用的本地恢复途径。','Format, chip, length, integrity or signature checks can reject unsuitable images, but cannot establish sensor operation, configuration migration or network recovery. Correct bytes can still contain a crashing program. Separate validated download from healthy application and retain a viable previous version plus local recovery access.'],
 ['启用回滚后，新应用先进入待确认','With rollback enabled, the new app must be confirmed','要使用框架的应用回滚状态机制，需在相应配置中启用CONFIG_BOOTLOADER_APP_ROLLBACK_ENABLE；不要假定它默认开启。新应用被标记NEW后首次启动，启动加载器将其转为PENDING_VERIFY。应用应运行有限而有意义的诊断，再调用esp_ota_mark_app_valid_cancel_rollback确认。确认不是“更新进度100%”自动等价的事件。','Application rollback state handling requires CONFIG_BOOTLOADER_APP_ROLLBACK_ENABLE where applicable; do not assume it is enabled by default. An image marked NEW enters PENDING_VERIFY on first boot. Run bounded, meaningful diagnostics and call esp_ota_mark_app_valid_cancel_rollback to confirm it. A 100% upload indicator is not equivalent to this health confirmation.'],
 ['未确认就重启，会发生什么','What happens if an unconfirmed image reboots','启用回滚时，待确认应用若未成功确认就再次重启，启动逻辑会将其判为ABORTED并尝试回到可用旧应用。显式诊断失败可用esp_ota_mark_app_invalid_rollback_and_reboot请求回滚。前提是确实有另一个符合条件的有效版本；若旧槽损坏、被擦除或因反回滚策略不再允许，不能承诺总能返回。','With rollback enabled, rebooting a pending image without successful confirmation leads the boot logic to mark it ABORTED and try a usable previous app. A diagnostic failure can explicitly request rollback with esp_ota_mark_app_invalid_rollback_and_reboot. This requires another eligible valid image; damaged, erased or anti-rollback-ineligible old slots cannot guarantee recovery.'],
 ['断电位置不同，结论也不同','Power interruption depends on the update stage','向非活动应用槽写入中断时，只要原运行镜像与启动选择仍完好，通常可继续使用旧版；此时未完成镜像不能被当成新启动目标。otadata采用冗余扇区机制提高更新启动信息的可靠性，但它不是对任何供电故障和任意Flash操作的绝对保证。模拟台分别处理下载中断与待确认重启，不将所有故障统一显示“已自动恢复”。','Interrupting a write to an inactive app slot can leave the old app usable when its image and boot selection remain intact; incomplete data must not become the new boot target. Redundant otadata sectors improve boot-metadata resilience but do not guarantee every possible power fault or flash operation. The trainer distinguishes interrupted download from reboot during pending verification.'],
 ['TLS、签名、Flash加密和反回滚各解决什么','Separate TLS, signing, flash encryption and anti-rollback','HTTPS及正确服务端证书验证保护下载连接与服务端身份；固件签名/安全启动用于建立镜像信任；Flash加密保护静态存储内容；反回滚策略限制启动过旧安全版本。它们不能相互替代。尤其不要关闭证书验证来掩盖证书错误，也不要在初学排错时随意烧写不可逆eFuse安全位。反回滚还可能使旧应用不再具备回退资格。','HTTPS with proper server verification protects the connection/server identity; image signing/secure boot establish image trust; flash encryption protects stored content; anti-rollback rejects older security versions. These layers are not interchangeable. Do not hide certificate errors by disabling verification or experiment with irreversible eFuse changes as a beginner fix. Anti-rollback may make a previous image ineligible as a fallback.'],
 ['按官方例子做一次可追溯更新试验','Run a traceable update experiment from the official example','使用与本机IDF版本匹配的官方OTA示例，先读README，配置target、网络、服务器证书与分区，再本地build/flash/monitor建立基线。日志记录运行分区、版本、更新返回值、待确认状态和确认结果。先在模型中走通失败/成功分支，再对可恢复的开发板做受控实验；本网页不下载真实固件、不操作Flash或安全位。','Use an official OTA example matching the installed IDF version. Read its README, configure target/network/server trust/partitions and establish a local build/flash/monitor baseline. Log running slot, version, update results, pending state and confirmation. Explore success/failure branches in the trainer before a recoverable hardware experiment. The webpage does not download real firmware or modify flash/security bits.']
 ],example:['初始ota_0运行v1且有效，ota_1容量1 MiB。接收700 KiB的v2写入ota_1，结束校验成功后才选择ota_1并重启。若已启用回滚，新版先处于PENDING_VERIFY：诊断通过→确认VALID；诊断失败或确认前重启→在旧ota_0仍有效且策略允许时回滚v1。另一个分支是在只收到300 KiB时中断：不选择不完整槽，保留v1。三个分支的成功标准不同，必须分别记录。','Start with valid v1 in ota_0 and a 1 MiB ota_1. Receive 700 KiB v2 into ota_1; only after successful completion checks select it and restart. With rollback enabled, v2 enters PENDING_VERIFY: successful diagnostics confirm VALID; failed diagnostics or reboot before confirmation can return to v1 if ota_0 remains eligible. A separate interruption after 300 KiB must not select the incomplete slot. Record these branches separately.'],
 error:['把otadata当固件槽；下载一半就切启动；认为双槽自动开启回滚；启动第一行无条件确认；把校验和当签名；忽略旧槽是否可回退。','Treating otadata as an app slot, selecting an incomplete image, assuming dual slots enable rollback, confirming unconditionally at startup, confusing integrity checks with signatures or ignoring fallback eligibility.'],
 task:[['为同一更新设计成功、下载中断和待确认失败三条结果链。','Design success, interrupted-download and failed-pending-verification paths for one update.'],['镜像校验成功但新程序启动崩溃，哪一步能决定它是否被保留？双槽本身足够吗？','An image validates but crashes on boot. Which step decides whether it is retained, and are two slots alone sufficient?'],['在ESP-IDF训练流程核对双槽与镜像大小，分别执行写入成功并确认、下载中断、待确认重启三种情况。','In the IDF trainer inspect slots/image size and run successful confirmation, interrupted download and reboot-before-confirmation cases.'],['写出运行槽、待启动槽、镜像状态与回滚前提，说明确认与字节校验的区别。','Record running/next-boot slots, image state and rollback prerequisites, separating health confirmation from byte validation.'],['读所用IDF版本官方OTA示例，画出本地构建/首次烧录与之后应用OTA的边界；不做不可逆安全配置试错。','Read the matching official example and map initial local provisioning versus later app OTA without experimenting with irreversible security settings.'],['保留三条状态时间线、容量检查与传输/签名/回滚层次表。','Keep three state timelines, capacity checks and a transport/signing/rollback layer table.'],['不把下载完成当健康完成，能正确预测三条分支并说明何时不能保证回滚。','Predict all three branches, distinguish download from health and explain when rollback cannot be guaranteed.']],refs:['idfota','partitions','httpsota','otaexample']}
);

